  speakerName: 
  storyText: "/* Memutar audio radio secara otomatis saat layar dimuat */\n        setup.sound.play(\"police_radio\", \"audio/sfx/police_radio.mp3\", false, 0.9);"
  narrativeBeats:
  - "You pull your emergency-band scanner from your gear bag. Your hands are shaking slightly as you dial into the encrypted precinct frequency.\n            \n                You boot up your rig, your fingers flying across the mechanical keyboard. You bypass the local scramblers, hunting for raw, unencrypted police chatter.\n            \n            The speaker hisses with white noise before a voice breaks through."
  - "FREQ: 154.790 MHz\n                \u25CF REC"
  - '[STATIC HISS]'
  - 'UNIT 4-CHARLIE:'
  - '"Dispatch, 4-Charlie! We''ve lost the 5th Street barricade! They are not stopping! I repeat, shooting them in the chest does nothing! They just keep coming!"'
  - '[HEAVY THUD / STRUGGLE]'
  - 'UNIT 4-CHARLIE:'
  - '"God damn it, get off the damn car! Dispatch, standard protocol is useless! Requesting authorization for unrestricted lethal force!"'
  - '[RADIO SQUELCH]'
  - 'DISPATCH (CALM):'
  - '"4-Charlie, unrestricted lethal force is authorized. All units, listen carefully. Standard rules of engagement are suspended. Body shots will not stop them. You must destroy the brain. Aim for the head. I repeat... aim for the head. Avoid all physical contact."'
  - '[SIGNAL CUTS OUT]'
  - "'Standard rules of engagement are suspended.' Total lethal force. No warnings, no arrests, no hesitation. They only issue that for active warzones. You stare at the radio. Whatever is out there, the law is officially dead.\n            \n                'You must destroy the brain.' You stare at the blinking green light of your monitor. The police aren't trying to control a riot. They are executing people in the streets."
  - "/* Add information to the Lore Database upon leaving */\n                    \n                    \n                    \n                \n                Add tactical intel to your PDA."
  dialogueLines: []
  initialFloorItems: []
  choices:
  - choiceLabel: Kill the radio and step back
    choiceSubtitle: Add tactical intel to your PDA.
